Subject: [PATCH] Add opt-in attribute caching for existing watched guest inodes

--notify-attr-timeout requires cache=never, zero negative timeout and
notifications. LOOKUP/CREATE/READDIRPLUS keep zero entry and attr timeouts;
a notification may precede installation of a new guest inode. GETATTR
subscribes before reading attrs and uses the guest attr_version guard.
Disabled by default.

